        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; background: #f8f9fa; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }\n    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2a5bd7 0%, #1a3ea0 100%); padding: 2rem; text-align: center; }\n    .header h1 { color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }\n    .body-content { padding: 2rem; }\n    .greeting { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #1a1a1a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }\n    .credentials { background: #f0f4ff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.2rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; }\n    .credentials p { margin: 0.4rem 0; color: #333; font-size: 0.95rem; }\n    .credentials strong { color: #2a5bd7; }\n    .cta-btn { display: inline-block; background: #2a5bd7; color: #ffffff; padding: 0.9rem 2rem; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; }\n    .footer { text-align: center; padding: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #999; }\n    .footer a { color: #2a5bd7; text-decoration: none; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <h1>LIVE LANGUAGE_RUSSIAN</h1>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"body-content\">\n      <p class=\"greeting\">Ciao {{ $json.firstName }},</p>\n      <p>La tua registrazione su <strong>Live Language Russian</strong> è completata!</p>\n      <p>Ecco le tue credenziali di accesso:</p>\n      <div class=\"credentials\">\n        <p><strong>Email:</strong> {{ $json.email }}</p>\n        <p><strong>Password:</strong> {{ $json.generatedPassword }}</p>\n      </div>\n      <p>Usa queste credenziali per accedere alla piattaforma e iniziare a esercitarti con la grammatica russa.</p>\n      <p style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.livelanguagerussian.com/auth.html?mode=login\" class=\"cta-btn\">Accedi ora</a>\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666;\">Ti consigliamo di cambiare la password dopo il primo accesso.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <p>&copy; Live Language Russian | <a href=\"https://www.livelanguagerussian.com\">www.livelanguagerussian.com</a></p>\n      <p><a href=\"mailto:info@livelanguagerussian.com\">info@livelanguagerussian.com</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "options": {}
